253
00:18:04,300 --> 00:18:07,300
So you have Devil Fruit
powers as well, do you?

254
00:18:08,040 --> 00:18:09,720
What a ditz!

255
00:18:52,560 --> 00:18:55,580
Oh, my God.

256
00:18:59,180 --> 00:19:00,160
That's it!

257
00:19:29,180 --> 00:19:30,010
Ah!

258
00:19:43,600 --> 00:19:44,920
Ah!

259
00:20:03,420 --> 00:20:05,320
It's a Buster Call!

260
00:20:05,600 --> 00:20:07,077
The battleships are coming!

261
00:20:07,160 --> 00:20:10,513
If we don't get moving, they're
gonna burn us to a crisp!

262
00:20:11,240 --> 00:20:12,080
Run away!

263
00:20:20,140 --> 00:20:21,080
I see.

264
00:20:21,380 --> 00:20:24,057
So you have so-and-type
double-root powers, do you?

265
00:20:24,140 --> 00:20:24,970
Are you dense?

266
00:20:25,140 --> 00:20:26,669
I told you, that's not me!

267
00:20:27,100 --> 00:20:29,571
But this isn't some random monster, is it?

268
00:20:29,740 --> 00:20:31,440
Those are reindeer antlers.

269
00:20:31,740 --> 00:20:33,900
And I'd recognize that cat anywhere.

270
00:20:35,380 --> 00:20:36,440
But what happened?

271
00:20:36,820 --> 00:20:39,680
Is that giant thing really, Chopper?

272
00:20:42,360 --> 00:20:45,020
Even so, I'd never see a beast like this.

273
00:20:47,380 --> 00:20:48,210
Boo-Boo!

274
00:20:51,480 --> 00:20:52,310
Tempest!

275
00:20:52,393 --> 00:20:53,223
Stop it!

276
00:20:53,306 --> 00:20:54,136
Leave him alone!

277
00:20:55,020 --> 00:20:57,200
Hey, Chopper, it's you, isn't it?

278
00:20:57,400 --> 00:20:58,500
What's going on?

279
00:20:58,700 --> 00:20:59,820
Did you do this?

280
00:21:08,760 --> 00:21:11,097
Maybe he just doesn't recognize me now.

281
00:21:11,180 --> 00:21:12,337
I must look strange.

282
00:21:12,420 --> 00:21:14,057
You are Chopper, aren't you?

283
00:21:14,140 --> 00:21:16,237
I was kidding. All right.

284
00:21:16,320 --> 00:21:18,757
I didn't think you actually
turned into that thing.

285
00:21:18,840 --> 00:21:20,377
Don't treat me like I'm a fool.

286
00:21:20,460 --> 00:21:22,017
Chopper.

287
00:21:22,100 --> 00:21:25,720
She ignored me so rude.

288
00:21:27,920 --> 00:21:30,100
Chopper, what's wrong with you?

289
00:21:30,300 --> 00:21:32,620
It's me, Nami! Look!

290
00:21:40,280 --> 00:21:41,800
Stop it!

291
00:21:46,220 --> 00:21:48,140
Why are you doing this?

292
00:22:07,860 --> 00:22:08,690
Oh, no!

293
00:22:08,773 --> 00:22:09,737
Sanchi's down there!

294
00:22:09,820 --> 00:22:13,497
I don't know where that awful thing
wandered in from, but I'll make it pay!

295
00:22:13,580 --> 00:22:15,197
Don't you lay a finger on him!

296
00:22:15,280 --> 00:22:17,104
I won't let you hurt my friend!

297
00:22:39,840 --> 00:22:41,720
What the heck happened to him?

298
00:22:44,160 --> 00:22:45,240
This isn't good.

299
00:22:45,500 --> 00:22:47,441
I need to find a way to stop him.

300
00:22:49,820 --> 00:22:52,400
That thing is your friend? How amusing.

301
00:22:52,760 --> 00:22:54,837
You pirates keep strange
company, don't you?

302
00:22:54,920 --> 00:22:55,860
Chopper!

303
00:22:58,420 --> 00:23:00,040
She ignored me again.

304
00:23:00,280 --> 00:23:01,515
How rude can you get?

305
00:23:02,320 --> 00:23:05,457
I'd love to have you take
care of that monster for me,

306
00:23:05,540 --> 00:23:08,246
but I've been given an
order to eliminate you.

307
00:23:08,660 --> 00:23:10,340
And time is running short.

308
00:23:11,480 --> 00:23:12,310
Tempest!

309
00:23:12,900 --> 00:23:13,730
Uh-oh!

310
00:23:13,813 --> 00:23:17,427
I don't think I can dodge, but
my legs are slippery like this!

311
00:23:20,300 --> 00:23:21,130
Huh?

312
00:23:21,213 --> 00:23:22,043
I'm still okay?

313
00:23:22,920 --> 00:23:24,837
One of my legs is back to normal.

314
00:23:24,920 --> 00:23:26,020
But why?

315
00:23:26,360 --> 00:23:27,595
Did I miss something?

316
00:23:28,820 --> 00:23:29,740
It's wet.

317
00:23:30,100 --> 00:23:32,917
It must have happened when
Chopper threw the bathtub.

318
00:23:33,000 --> 00:23:34,820
Wait, I get it.

319
00:23:35,020 --> 00:23:37,902
All I have to do is wash
the soap off with water.

320
00:23:52,440 --> 00:23:53,757
Let's not be hasty.

321
00:23:53,840 --> 00:23:57,237
Even if you can counter the
effects Of my golden bubbles with

322
00:23:57,320 --> 00:24:01,085
water That doesn't mean I'm going
to stand by And let you do it?

323
00:24:04,080 --> 00:24:05,040
Sheep cloud

324
00:24:06,000 --> 00:24:06,857
Relaxing bubbles.

325
00:24:06,940 --> 00:24:08,640
No problem!

326
00:24:08,920 --> 00:24:11,077
This is nothing a little wind can't fix!

327
00:24:11,160 --> 00:24:12,400
Now, side blow!

328
00:24:13,480 --> 00:24:14,640
Damn it!

329
00:24:18,580 --> 00:24:20,300
Oh, no!

330
00:24:20,800 --> 00:24:22,300
My strength is...

331
00:24:24,820 --> 00:24:26,560
Supple finger pistol!

332
00:24:27,520 --> 00:24:29,500
My tag whip!

333
00:24:45,920 --> 00:24:48,477
That was helpful. Helpful.

334
00:24:48,560 --> 00:24:53,857
If you blow me away with
an attack like that,

335
00:24:53,940 --> 00:24:59,297
then those annoying bubbles of yours
get blown away too, aren't you tough?

336
00:24:59,380 --> 00:25:02,877
Well, if you like, I'll blow you
away until there's nothing left.

337
00:25:02,960 --> 00:25:08,317
The forecast is cloudy.

338
00:25:08,400 --> 00:25:14,837
This sure beats that

339
00:25:14,920 --> 00:25:15,750
magic show stuff.

340
00:25:15,833 --> 00:25:21,437
This thing used to do clouds
fighting with lightning again.

341
00:25:21,520 --> 00:25:26,257
These clouds aren't
for lightning. They're?

342
00:25:26,340 --> 00:25:27,634
Way too thin for that.

343
00:25:27,840 --> 00:25:30,940
This time, I have something else in mind.

344
00:25:31,200 --> 00:25:32,080
I see.

345
00:25:32,420 --> 00:25:33,949
Damn, I should have known.

346
00:25:34,960 --> 00:25:36,660
The forecast is rain.

347
00:25:37,120 --> 00:25:38,240
Pool ball!

348
00:25:40,580 --> 00:25:41,680
Pour down!

349
00:25:42,120 --> 00:25:43,060
Rain temple!

350
00:25:51,660 --> 00:25:53,460
And I work so hard.

351
00:25:53,720 --> 00:25:55,840
How rude to wash everything away.

352
00:25:56,340 --> 00:26:00,220
If your idea of nice is getting
my ass beat, then I'll pass.

353
00:26:00,980 --> 00:26:02,260
Full charge!

354
00:26:09,040 --> 00:26:10,160
Mirage tempo!

355
00:26:13,200 --> 00:26:14,260
She's gone.

356
00:26:14,560 --> 00:26:16,320
I've watched your every move.

357
00:26:16,600 --> 00:26:18,240
I know your strengths.

358
00:26:19,160 --> 00:26:22,000
And I know all your weaknesses as well.

359
00:26:22,960 --> 00:26:23,960
What's happening?

360
00:26:26,340 --> 00:26:27,940
Mirage Tempo!

361
00:26:29,340 --> 00:26:31,060
Fight Morgana!
